knowthelist (2.4.2-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * New upstream release with offline Debian builds using packaged JUCE and
    explicit FLAC/Vorbis codec linking.
  * Link libogg explicitly to resolve JUCE Vorbis codec symbols when using
    Debian's packaged JUCE modules, and add libogg-dev to Build-Depends.
  * Require SoundTouch for pitch-preserving tempo changes and Qt SVG plugins
    for transition icons.
  * Update Debian build dependencies and ensure source uploads include the
    upstream orig tarball.

