 -- Mario Stephan <mstephan@shared-files.de>  Sat, 26 Sep 2026 20:59:50 +0200

knowthelist (2.4.1-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Audio and Auto-DJ:
    - Introduced the JUCE-based audio backend, replacing GStreamer-based
      playback.
    - Added an adaptive transition planner that selects a suitable transition
      for each track pair, including beat/phrase blend, bass swap, vocal/mid
      handoff, equal-power blend, and hard cut. Plans refresh when track state
      changes and during fades.
  * Continued improvements to BPM and beat analysis:
    - Improved tempo accuracy and beat/bar-phase estimation, added low-end
      confidence handling and transition cue modes, and updated analysis cache
      versioning.
    - Added beat/bar markers to waveform displays and improved beat-jump
      controls.
  * Playback, usability, and interface:
    - Added seek muting and improved playback-position handling; refined
      skip-forward playlist behavior and slider controls.
    - Added last-played timestamps and refreshed player and main-window
      layouts, controls, fonts, faders, and styling.

 -- Mario Stephan <mstephan@shared-files.de>  Wed, 19 Aug 2026 21:02:35 +0200

